| `scripts/jobs/restamp_docs.py` | Sets a stale `updated:` to today, so a fresh render passes the freshness rule. | runs under `copier copy` and `copier update`; `make restamp-docs` | [`scripts/jobs/restamp_docs.py --today`](settings.md#command-line-flags) | Changes no byte but the stamp. Escaping writes exit 2; mutations use the confined resolved path. | [idempotency.md](../guides/idempotency.md) | always |
